      "t": "While walking through the dining room, Chef Barinov's daughter Katya spots her childhood friend Lilya. The two women have competed fiercely since kindergarten, so when Lilya introduces her wealthy husband, Katya invents a fiancé on the spot. Let's listen to their rivalry in Russian.",
